#: ../../../developer/general/how-to-edit-the-website.rst:28
#: b87e6bea58c24169ba2e82005a285981
msgid ""
"To give your contribution a better chance of being accepted, please follow "
"our :doc:`website style guide </developer/general/website-style-guide>`."
